  "name": "Adv 0 - 通知中心 [共用 Sub-Workflow：severity 分流 → Discord / Email]",
  "description": null,
  "active": true,
  "isArchived": false,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Adv 0：通知中心（Notify Hub）\n\n**所有情境共用的通知出口** — Adv 1-6 的關鍵事件都打到這裡，\n由這一個 workflow 統一決定怎麼通知、通知誰。\n\n**呼叫方式**（任何 workflow 加一個 HTTP Request 節點）：\n```\nPOST http://localhost:5678/webhook/notify-hub\n{ \"source\": \"adv1-dedup\", \"severity\": \"critical\",\n  \"title\": \"新 Critical 事件\", \"message\": \"...\" }\n```\n\n**分流規則**：\n- critical → Discord @here 緊急通知（+ Email，需 SMTP 設定後啟用）\n- 其他 → Discord 一般訊息\n\n**集中的好處**：換通知管道（Teams/LINE/簡訊）只改這裡，\n六個情境 workflow 一行都不用動。",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 480
      },
      "id": "adv0-note",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -64,
        -208
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 通知出口設定（2026-08-21 改版）\n\n- **critical** → 真實 Jira 開單（Jira Basic Auth，同 Lab A）\n- **非 critical** → mock-api `POST /api/notify`（`GET /api/notify` 可查收到的通知）\n\n原 Discord/Email 版本需自行填 Webhook URL / SMTP，課堂改用上述兩出口。",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 380
      },
      "id": "adv0-note2",
      "name": "Sticky Note 2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1104,
        -160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "notify-hub",
        "responseMode": "lastNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "adv0-wh",
      "name": "Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
